<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis (Vertebrate midgut & dorsal mesentery (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Taeniopygia guttata, Mus musculus))",
        "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Vertebrate midgut & dorsal mesentery (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Taeniopygia guttata, Mus musculus) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Vertebrate midgut & dorsal mesentery (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Taeniopygia guttata, Mus musculus) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 54.5/100, audit 2026-10-19-gut-looping-differential-growth-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py> ;
    schema:about "Vertebrate midgut & dorsal mesentery (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Taeniopygia guttata, Mus musculus)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py; output: docs/media/gut_looping_differential_growth_comparison.png; organism: Vertebrate midgut & dorsal mesentery (Gallus gallus, Coturnix japonica, Taeniopygia guttata, Mus musculus); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 643f6989deff1f1d47f576fe1e43c257f747c5e39321e10638b972d0ac0dc491; artifact_sha256: a509fa903edf6a286172076d79d801863c3bac04a90bdbc10f3298cd0a884e04; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/gut_looping_differential_growth_reference.json=f73121bb4140187f..., datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/intestine_mesentery_specimen.jpg=e12fee9ac1fb5f3d..., datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/paper_citations.bib=21703c48df51dd52..., datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/scout_manifest.json=0723b42b4d825087...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature10277>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.0803578105>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1618677114> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-model-fidelity>,
