    dct:description "Evaluates 5 embryonic stages of Chick (E8-E16) across differential strain epsilon in [1.26, 3.72] (L68-92), but lacks the 14-point 4-species morphospace sweep (Zebra finch, Quail, Chick, Mouse), omits Nerurkar et al. (2017) BMP2 and Noggin perturbations plus surgical mesentery ablation (epsilon = 0), and exposes no CLI parameters for epsilon, E_t/E_m, R_t, h_m, or seed (L250-256)." ;
